{"Title":"An Act authorizing the town of Tewksbury to lease the Louise Davy Trahan Elementary School for not more than 99 years","BillNumber":"S2582","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"BRF0","Name":"Barry R. Finegold","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BRF0","ResponseDate":"2024-01-31T17:34:57.673"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"BRF0","Name":"Barry R. Finegold","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BRF0","ResponseDate":"2024-01-31T17:34:57.6733333"},{"Id":"TTN1","Name":"Tram T. Nguyen","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/TTN1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-17T00:01:41.97"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2582/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"Senate, February 5, 2024 -- Substituted as a new draft (Senator Finegold) for the Senate Bill authorizing the town of Tewksbury to lease the Trahan Elementary School for a term of years not exceeding 99 years (Senate, No. 2485).","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding section 3 of chapter 40 of the General Laws or of any other general or special law to the contrary, but subject to paragraphs (a), (b) and (g) of section 16 of chapter 30B of the General Laws, the town of Tewksbury may lease the Louise Davy Trahan Elementary School for a term of not more than 99 years.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S31"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}